NAME: Stock

DESCRIPTION:

Current price and a price history
graph for a stock ticker.

Tap Ticker, or the symbol, and enter
a symbol such as AAPL or MSFT.
Index symbols such as ^GSPC work too.

Choose the graph duration:
- 1D   one day
- 5D   five days
- 1M   one month
- 6M   six months
- 1Y   one year
- 5Y   five years
- YTD  year to date

The change under the price is from
the prior close. Green is up and
red is down.

On the longer graphs, the percent
at the right is the change across
that duration.

Tap R to refresh. A quote already
downloaded is reused for one minute.

NOTES:

Prices are downloaded from
Yahoo Finance. A network
connection is required.

Downloading can take a few seconds.
